  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: df58795d0a3134c5da043aa1a759d47b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Mabel_FirstMeeting
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Arlen::Arlen.DialogueSystem.DialogueData
  defaultSpeaker: Mabel
  lines:
  - speaker: 
    text: Well, look who's back! I was starting to think the wilds had finally swallowed you whole.
  - speaker: You
    text: Takes more than a few bandits and one very rude bear. Is that cinnamon I smell?
  - speaker: 
    text: Honey-cinnamon rolls, fresh this morning. One's yours if you promise to look in on Eldon.
  - speaker: 
    text: He hasn't been by for his morning loaf in three days. Three! That old cartographer never misses.
  - speaker: You
    text: He's probably buried under a mountain of maps again. I'll check on him.
  - speaker: 
    text: And mind the north side of the stream, dear. Bram says boar ruffians have been prowling about Mosswood.
